license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/nadavWeisler/jsPsychConjunctiveCPT
url: https://github.com/nadavWeisler/jsPsychConjunctiveCPT
abstract: >-
  jsPsych 6 plugin and example timeline for the Conjunctive Continuous
  Performance Task (CCPT), a sustained-attention task in which participants
  respond only to one shape-color conjunction.
